  "2026-08-30T15:18:48.860Z",pi-agent,"Rebased onto origin/main. Resolved .github/workflows/release.yml by retaining main current protected-release and provenance flow while adding --date-from-version to all three generator invocations; resolved package.json by retaining the provenance verifier and release gate while adding --date-from-version and the changelog-date verifier; resolved .github/workflows/ci.yml by retaining both verifier jobs. npm run verify:release-changelog-date, npm test, and npm run release:check passed; coverage remained 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. Regression proof: removing --date-from-version from package.json made npm run verify:release-changelog-date exit nonzero with four package.json failures, then restoring it passed."
